1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,480
(Celestial Duchy)
Welcome to Prosperity.

2
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:18,199
The defendant, Tu Jiasheng,

3
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,920
is accused of forming and leading

4
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,879
a vicious underworld syndicate,

5
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:24,839
intentional bodily harm,
unlawful detention,

6
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:27,104
bribery of public officials,

7
00:00:27,296 --> 00:00:29,440
(Prosperity Accounts)
and harboring criminals,

8
00:00:29,519 --> 00:00:30,800
among multiple felonies.

9
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:32,640
Upon this court's review,

10
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:33,799
the facts are clear

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,880
and the evidence is irrefutable.

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,600
(Sea Breeze Prison)
This court now delivers final verdict.

13
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,079
Prosperity

14
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:40,719
is left to you now.

15
00:00:42,399 --> 00:00:45,119
(Year 2005)
Tu Jiasheng is given life imprisonment,

16
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,280
deprived of all civil
and political rights,

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,039
effective immediately.

18
00:00:49,804 --> 00:00:52,786
=The Glory Fades 2=

19
00:00:52,786 --> 00:00:54,624
=Episode 1=

20
00:00:54,624 --> 00:00:55,624
(Sea Breeze Prison)

21
00:00:55,906 --> 00:00:56,939
Get him!

22
00:01:01,325 --> 00:01:02,389
Get him!

23
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,799
One, two, three!

24
00:01:07,449 --> 00:01:10,499
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

25
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,760
(Tu Jiasheng)
Hey, new guy.

26
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:24,519
Aren't you going to put on a show?

27
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:31,439
(The Grand Princess)
Tu Jiasheng's in Sea Breeze Prison?

28
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,560
Yes.

29
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,599
Bringing him to justice this time

30
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:37,640
(Nie Feng)
was all thanks to your full support.

31
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:40,319
No one is above the law.

32
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:42,120
He deserves it.

33
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,280
You're absolutely right.

34
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,439
Speaking of princes,

35
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,120
as for the young prince,

36
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,040
I'll keep an eye on him for you.

37
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,840
Our Nie family will always
be your eyes and ears.

38
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,359
What are you talking about?

39
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,799
He's my brother,

40
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:58,159
the future king.

41
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,719
Looking out for him

42
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,719
is only natural.

43
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,959
Sea Breeze Prison

44
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,759
is the Nie family's turf, isn't it?

45
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,159
Will Tu Jiasheng

46
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,719
make it out alive?

47
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:23,599
He's still useful to me.

48
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,479
Keep him alive for now.

49
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,840
(Your Highness,)

50
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,439
(what use is he to you?)

51
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,680
(Whatever you need,)

52
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,680
you can always turn to...

53
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,080
How dare you!

54
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,280
Forgive me, Your Highness.

55
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,680
I got it.

56
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,240
Tu Jiasheng

57
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,840
won't die.

58
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,199
Get out.

59
00:03:01,249 --> 00:03:02,991
(Tang Zhen)

60
00:03:31,837 --> 00:03:32,837
(Nie)

61
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:35,759
Hello, Mr. Nie.

62
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,120
Has Jiasheng

63
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,120
arrived?

64
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,199
Don't worry.

65
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,520
He's getting a grand welcome now.

66
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,599
The Grand Princess' order is

67
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,599
to keep him alive for now.

68
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Forgive my ignorance,

69
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,400
please advise, sir.

70
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,159
Then make him wish

71
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,800
he was dead.

72
00:04:01,377 --> 00:04:02,446
Understood.

73
00:04:02,446 --> 00:04:04,271
- Hit him!
- Beat him up!

74
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,800
You mean...

75
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:21,560
This is Sea Breeze Prison after all.

76
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:23,480
If a brawl breaks out among inmates

77
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,800
and ends in a tragic death,

78
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:27,680
Her Highness could hardly
blame you for it.

79
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,319
You sly dog.

80
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:35,879
Your Majesty...

81
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,759
Your Highness,

82
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,360
word is Nie Feng is running for Speaker.

83
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,839
Are you really going to back him?

84
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,399
Give him what he wants,

85
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:48,639
and he'll do your bidding.

86
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,959
The higher he climbs now,

87
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,560
the harder he'll fall later.

88
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,959
Tu Jiasheng,

89
00:04:58,399 --> 00:05:00,600
I hope you're tough enough to survive.

90
00:05:03,493 --> 00:05:04,775
- Hit him!
- Come on!

91
00:05:04,775 --> 00:05:05,775
Get him!

92
00:05:05,801 --> 00:05:06,801
Get him!

93
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,060
Beat him!

94
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,959
Choke him!

95
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:50,040
Choke him out!

96
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:52,079
Choke him!

97
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:54,079
Choke him!

98
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,399
- Choke him!
- Choke him!

99
00:06:05,245 --> 00:06:06,693
Help!

100
00:06:24,184 --> 00:06:29,356
(Two hours before Tu Jiasheng
was imprisoned)

101
00:08:07,596 --> 00:08:09,691
(Zhao Lu)

102
00:08:14,917 --> 00:08:15,917
Your hair.

103
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:36,080
Jiasheng, I know you blame me,

104
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,399
but we're running out of time.

105
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,879
We can talk
once you're across the border.

106
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,080
Let me get you out first.

107
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,840
Feng is blackmailing you
with your father.

108
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,879
- I know.
- Sea Breeze Prison is Nie's turf.

109
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,120
If you go in there,

110
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,960
there's nothing we can do to help you.

111
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,159
I have to go.

112
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,639
Why?

113
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,519
There's something in there I want.

114
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,559
Jiasheng,

115
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,480
make it out alive.

116
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,200
If you're not dead,

117
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:23,879
get up and register.

118
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,440
Remember,

119
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,679
from now on,

120
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,720
you're 4167.

121
00:09:46,124 --> 00:09:49,377
(Sea Breeze Prison)

122
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,759
Captain Xia,

123
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:58,159
orders from above regarding this inmate.

124
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,159
Take care of him.

125
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,600
(Xia Yuyan)
Yes, sir.

126
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:27,399
Whatever you do in Sea Breeze,

127
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,679
you ask for permission.

128
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,159
Even for nodding.

129
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,240
Let me teach you the rules.

130
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:41,399
Kneel down!

131
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,519
Call me Officer!

132
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,600
I asked you to kneel!

133
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,960
I...

134
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:49,240
- Let go of him!
- Let go!

135
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,399
- Let go!
- Let go!

136
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,480
Stop it!

137
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,240
Captain Xia,
the new guy didn't know better.

138
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:02,279
I was teaching him the ropes.

139
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,360
Teach him properly then.

140
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:08,879
Yes, ma'am.

141
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,559
My knees are bad.

142
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:17,919
I can't kneel.

143
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:25,799
Can't kneel?

144
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,480
Then sit down.

145
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,720
This is Sea Breeze.

146
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:33,320
Even the toughest spine

147
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,159
gets broken here.

148
00:11:57,858 --> 00:12:01,474
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

149
00:12:01,844 --> 00:12:05,829
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

150
00:12:10,585 --> 00:12:13,904
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

151
00:12:13,904 --> 00:12:18,989
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

152
00:12:22,578 --> 00:12:29,130
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

153
00:12:29,130 --> 00:12:37,551
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

154
00:12:37,551 --> 00:12:40,780
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

155
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:43,975
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

156
00:12:43,975 --> 00:12:46,668
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

157
00:12:46,668 --> 00:12:51,285
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

158
00:12:55,196 --> 00:12:57,685
♪Burning alone♪

159
00:13:03,191 --> 00:13:09,560
♪The glory fades♪
